Here is a JavaScript function that reverses a string:

```javascript
function reverseString(str) {
    return str.split('').reverse().join('');
}
```

This function works by splitting the input string into an array of characters, reversing the array using the `reverse()` method, and then joining the array back into a string using the `join()` method.

